---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>84Hz</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="84Hz is a systems-thinking studio exploring AI, governance, engineering, organizations, careers, and technology."
    />

    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      body {
        font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
          sans-serif;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #111111;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 64px 24px;
      }

      main {
        max-width: 700px;
        width: 100%;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        margin-bottom: 64px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.25;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        margin-bottom: 56px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.9;
        color: #555;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      strong {
        color: #111;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .closing {
        margin-top: 56px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        color: #111;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .footer {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d8d8;
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
      }

      a:hover {
        border-color: #111;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        h1 {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          margin-bottom: 48px;
        }

        h2 {
          font-size: 1.7rem;
        }

        p {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>84Hz</h1>

      <h2>
        Most organizations don't have technology problems. They're experiencing the outcomes of the systems they've designed.
      </h2>

      <p>
        <strong>84Hz is a systems-thinking studio.</strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        The most interesting challenges in AI, governance, engineering,
        organizations, careers, and technology rarely exist in isolation. They
        emerge from the interaction of people, incentives, policies,
        architectures, and decisions over time. Understanding those
        interactions is often the difference between treating symptoms and
        redesigning the system that created them.
      </p>

      <p>
        This is where I explore those systems through essays, research, mental
        models, and practical frameworks, drawing ideas from science,
        engineering, technology, and organizational design.
      </p>

      <p class="closing">
        Thinking in public. Building with intention.
      </p>

      <div class="footer">
        Reach me on Instagram → 
        <a href="https://instagram.com/loopwithvijay" target="_blank">
           @loopwithvijay <br/>
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>